MODULE: RedirectInstalledOnCompletionRestoreOmitsRedirect
TARGET: RedirectInstalledOnCompletion
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: restore completes without arming the retained copy for stale routers
PERTURBS: RestoreRedirect

--- FIND
    /\ redirect' = [redirect EXCEPT ![source] = "restored"]
--- REPLACE
    /\ redirect' = redirect
--- END
